# Local Atlas Ask history
governance/ai/knowledge/atlas/history/
.playwright-mcp/
.sdtk/atlas/
.sdtk/handoff/
# BK-318/319 project memory layer: pages/graph/provenance ARE the tracked
# deliverable (the point is a durable, agent-queryable .sdtk/wiki in git).
# ATLAS_STATE.json is only an incremental-rebuild cache (mtime+hash+parsed
# doc per file) fully regenerable via `atlas build` — excluded to keep the
# repo lean; excluding it costs nothing but a slower first rebuild.
.sdtk/wiki/graph/ATLAS_STATE.json
# BK-321: the viewer UI artifacts are likewise regenerable via `atlas build`
# and carry no knowledge of their own — the tracked value is pages/ + the
# graph/index JSONs. viewer-data.js is the externalized doc corpus (a
# serialization of SDTK_DOC_INDEX.json), viewer.html the template render.
.sdtk/wiki/graph/viewer.html
.sdtk/wiki/graph/viewer-data.js
.sdtk/wiki/graph/mermaid.min.js
# BK-316 evolve: staging/state are machine-transient; LEARNED.md stays trackable
# (committed here deliberately — team-shared lessons, OQ-EV-3 'commit' posture).
.sdtk/evolve/staging/
.sdtk/evolve/state.json
# Agent-team runtime scratch only (BK-260). The plan JSON and task packets under
# .sdtk/agent-team/ are tracked deliverables and must NOT be ignored.
.sdtk/agent-team/runs/
# Per-run export bundles (BK-262) are transient derived output; the plan + task
# packets remain the tracked source of truth.
.sdtk/agent-team/exports/
# Phase C agent-team trace output — session-scoped, transient, not deliverables.
# Plan JSON and task packets remain tracked (see comment above).
.sdtk/agent-team/evidence/
.sdtk/agent-team/readiness/
.sdtk/agent-team/reports/
.sdtk/agent-team/worktrees/
.superpowers/

# Private signing keys must never be committed. Public keys live under
# products/**/assets/keys/ and are NOT matched by these patterns.
.sdtk/*.pem
*.private.pem

# Supabase CLI local artifacts (link state, temp cache) — generated by
# `supabase link` / `supabase functions deploy`, not source.
distribution/supabase/.temp/
distribution/supabase/supabase/

# Local context capsule collection input
/governance/ai/session/.context-capsule-input/
.vercel

# Local OSS reference clones (do not commit)
/references/
/reference/

# SDTK-AKB benchmark runner output bundles (BK-290A) — never committed
tests/akb/.out/
/akb-review-out/

# BK-376 wiki-memory runtime state (marker + log; the MEMORY doc itself is tracked under governance/)
.sdtk/wiki-memory/
